        P("Taken together the results support a measured, partly positive conclusion: the encryption layer meets its specification and is cheap; the detection layer works on real traffic with a high ranking quality but a false-alarm rate that needs a higher threshold; "
          "the added complexity of stacking is not justified by the data; and the number the product shows by default describes its synthetic generator, not the world."),
